            "review_text": "Er H\n1 contribution\n0\nReview of Food\nMar 2026 • Solo\nI had the opportunity to visit a small restaurant in TP.HCM and was really impressed. The room is clean and friendly and staff friendly.\n\nThe time of service is fast, not waiting long even though the restaurant is quite crowded. This is a great place to visit if you want to enjoy local cuisine.\n\nI will definitely come back next time.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 29, 2026",
